  "description": "The ultimate urban commuter? We know so.\nWant to get to work in effortless style? The Blacktop is for you. The Blacktop 1.0 accommodates your style and transforms your commuting options.\nWith a Bafang hub motor giving assistance and Shimano 9 speed gearing, you’ll arrive on time and ready to do your thing.\nWe have packed the Blacktop 1.0 with everything as standard. Mudguards, rack, heavy duty rear stand, ergo grips, and LCD display. You are ready to go as soon as you leave the showroom.\nDesigned for safety as well as function, the Blacktop 1.0 is fitted with hydraulic disc brakes and wide 2.2” semi slick tyres to keep you on the road and under control in all weathers.\nDitch the car, ditch the pollution, ditch sitting in traffic, ditch the parking problems…… Choose shorter commutes, choose door to door travel, choose fitness, choose a Blacktop.",
